@format 1
@id queue.reset-work
@title Reset cancelled or failed work
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary The work item is pending with a fresh retry and recovery history.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.load
@tag queue
@tag reset-work

@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Reset cancelled or failed work request <input>
- Receive the selected work identifier or live work item @ schedule.LScheduleItemReset(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply durable transition <decision>
- Move a cancelled or failed record to scheduled storage and clear ownership, counters, progress, and message @ schedule.LScheduleItemReset(...)
? "Durable transition succeeds" > result
? "Record is absent or storage transition fails" > failed

[result] Schedule changed <output>
=The work item is pending with a fresh retry and recovery history.

[failed] Transition failed <error>
= Existing durable work state remains authoritative.
